  "memo": "This tree is a versatile evergreen that thrives in urban landscapes. It features glossy, dark green leaves that emit a pleasant fragrance when crushed. Its dense foliage provides excellent shade and privacy, making it a popular choice for gardens and streetscapes. During the spring, it produces small, yellowish flowers that add a subtle touch of color. The tree is drought-tolerant and requires minimal maintenance, making it ideal for areas with limited water resources. Its moderate growth rate and manageable size make it suitable for both small and large spaces.",
